/storage/

# Outputs from ad-hoc example/system-test runs. The leading underscore is
# load-bearing: the go tool skips _-prefixed directories, so `go build ./...`
# will not walk into run outputs that contain .go files. Without it this
# directory needs its own go.mod to stay out of the module.
/_test-results/

# Transitional migration scaffolding — not part of understanding the repo.
.go-migrate/
